OL,3,GWest Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA small chance of a shower this
OL,6,Fmorning over the Peak District, and
OL,7,Fsome cloud bubbling up elsewhere
OL,8,Fduring the day. Otherwise dry with
OL,9,Fplenty of sunny spells and lighter
OL,10,Fwinds than of late. Feeling pleasant
OL,11,Fin the sunshine.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FA fine evening with some late
OL,14,Fsunshine. Clear spells developing for
OL,15,Fa while tonight, but clouding over
OL,16,Flater in the night perhaps with a few
OL,17,Fshowers.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
