OL,2,W+.-'"-$/*%*%*%/"-$/*%Q,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GWest Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,CSunday:FOutbreaks of showery rain
OL,6,Fmoving through during the morning,
OL,7,Fperhaps turning heavy at times.
OL,8,FBecoming dry and warm in the afternoon
OL,9,Fthough, with some bright spells
OL,10,Fbreaking through.
OL,11,
OL,12,COutlook for Monday to Wednesday:
OL,13,FUnsettled at first with spells of
OL,14,Fshowery rain at times and brisk winds.
OL,15,FSettling down by midweek though with
OL,16,Fspells of sunshine, and temperatures
OL,17,Faround the seasonal average.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
